		{"id":"scl-art-text","type":"text","text":"## ☀️ SUNLIT CIVIC COMMONS\nWarm limestone • muted terracotta • sand concrete • sage trees • cobalt route marks • burnt-orange accents\n\n🏙️ 3–6 story human-scale perimeter\n🏟️ Arena is the single north landmark\n🌳 Mature shade + worn brick paving\n🛍️ Separate clothing and furniture entrances\n🚫 No luxury resort, futurism, water city, monuments, or final assets","x":20,"y":550,"width":660,"height":330,"color":"2"},
