		{"id":"scl-footer","type":"text","text":"## PLANNING PROJECTION — NOT RUNTIME EVIDENCE\n🚶 260 cm/s → approximately 5:08 • 🏃 520 cm/s → approximately 2:34\nFootprint ceiling: 340 m × 280 m • clear path: 4 m normal / 3 m pinch • continuous and step-free\n\n**Next:** Phase 1C.2 builds a separate primitive Unreal graybox, packages it, and records actual route, collision, visibility, and performance evidence.","x":0,"y":970,"width":1800,"height":210,"color":"6"}
